{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-165766-r4587195","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:Fleischnacka (Alsatian Meat and Pasta Roll)","sourcePageId":165766,"sourceRevision":"4587195","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2025-10-26T23:28:09Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Codename Noreste","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Fleischnacka%20(Alsatian%20Meat%20and%20Pasta%20Roll)&oldid=4587195","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T12:54:15.393Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Alsatian recipes","Category:Boiled recipes","Category:French recipes","Category:Main course recipes","Category:Medium Difficulty recipes","Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes for pastries","Category:Recipes using beef broth and stock","Category:Recipes using egg","Category:Recipes using garlic","Category:Recipes using ground beef","Category:Recipes using wheat flour","Category:Recipes with images","Category:Recipes without cooking time","Category:Recipes without servings"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"cc6194cf8fd789f745ac0294ff12bf73499221447bce8180dc1d4a63355c6825","sourceWikitext":"__NOTOC__{{Recipe summary\n| Difficulty = 3\n| Image = [[File:Fleischschnacka.JPG|300px]]\n}}\n\n{{recipe}} | [[Cookbook:Cuisine of France#Alsace|Alsatian recipes]]\n\n'''''Fleischnacka''''' or '''''Fleischschnacka''''',<ref>Though {{wp|Alsace}} is a small region of France, its dialect varies pretty much between areas.</ref> literally ''\"snails of meat\"'' (from German ''\"Fleisch\"'', ''meat'', and ''\"Schnecke\"'', ''snail'') is an Alsatian dish consisting of minced beef (or sometimes other meats, like left over [[Cookbook:Pot-au-feu|pot-au-feu]]) rolled in fresh noodle dough and cut into slices, which are then cooked in stock.\n\n==Ingredients==\n\n=== Dough ===\n*1 [[Cookbook:Pound|lb]] [[Cookbook:flour|flour]]\n*4 [[Cookbook:Each|ea]]. [[Cookbook:Egg|eggs]]\n*[[Cookbook:Salt|Salt]]\n*1 [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] [[Cookbook:Water|water]]\n\n=== Filling ===\n*2½ lb [[Cookbook:Mince|minced]] [[Cookbook:Beef|beef]]\n*1 large [[Cookbook:Onion|onion]]\n*3 cloves [[Cookbook:Garlic|garlic]]\n*[[Cookbook:Nutmeg|Nutmeg]]\n*Salt\n*[[Cookbook:Pepper|Pepper]]\n*[[Cookbook:Oil and Fat|Oil]]\n*2 [[Cookbook:Pint|pints]] beef [[Cookbook:Stock|stock]]\n*4 cups Riesling [[Cookbook:Wine|wine]] (optional)\n\n== Procedure ==\n#Mix together the flour and eggs, then add the water and salt.\n#[[Cookbook:Kneading|Knead]] the [[Cookbook:Dough|dough]] until smooth and set aside for 1 hour.\n#Mince the onion, parsley, and garlic. Mix into the minced meat along with the eggs, nutmeg, salt and pepper.\n#[[Cookbook:Dough#Rolling|Roll out]] the dough into a rectangle.\n#Spread the meat filling evenly over the dough and roll up into a cylinder. Seal the edge with water and cut into slices (not too thick).\n#Brown the slices in oil. \n#Add the stock (and wine if used), and cook for 20 minutes.\n#Serve with a green salad.\n== References ==\n<references/>\n\n[[Category:Recipes using ground beef]]\n[[Category:Boiled recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes for pastries]]\n[[Category:Main course recipes]]\n[[Category:French recipes|{{PAGENAME}}]]\n[[Category:Alsatian recipes|{{PAGENAME}}]]\n[[Category:Recipes with images]]\n[[Category:Recipes using egg]]\n[[Category:Recipes using wheat flour]]\n[[Category:Recipes using garlic]]\n[[Category:Recipes using beef broth and stock]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Fleischnacka (Alsatian Meat and Pasta Roll)","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"1 lb flour","sourceText":"1 lb flour","amountText":"1 lb flour","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"4 ea. eggs","sourceText":"4 ea. eggs","amountText":"4 ea. eggs","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"Salt","sourceText":"Salt","amountText":"Salt","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"1 cup water","sourceText":"1 cup water","amountText":"1 cup water","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"2½ lb minced beef","sourceText":"2½ lb minced beef","amountText":"2½ lb minced beef","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-6","name":"1 large onion","sourceText":"1 large onion","amountText":"1 large onion","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-7","name":"3 cloves garlic","sourceText":"3 cloves garlic","amountText":"3 cloves garlic","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-8","name":"Nutmeg","sourceText":"Nutmeg","amountText":"Nutmeg","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-9","name":"Salt","sourceText":"Salt","amountText":"Salt","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-10","name":"Pepper","sourceText":"Pepper","amountText":"Pepper","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-11","name":"Oil","sourceText":"Oil","amountText":"Oil","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-12","name":"2 pints beef stock","sourceText":"2 pints beef stock","amountText":"2 pints beef stock","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-13","name":"4 cups Riesling wine (optional)","sourceText":"4 cups Riesling wine (opt